{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012Rpgc5VNE8WZcQqPrqbZXD","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"SigLIP+Projector RSA baseline\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO — 证明 action-relevant 结构源自 frozen vision encoder\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"siglip_projector_rsa\": 0.6153,\n7\t      \"bootstrap_95_ci\": [\n8\t        0.5257,\n9\t        0.6954\n10\t      ],\n11\t      \"trained_vla_peak_rsa\": 0.4876,\n12\t      \"untrained_vla_peak_rsa\": 0.4846,\n13\t      \"dino_rsa\": 0.388,\n14\t      \"llm_degradation_magnitude\": 0.127\n15\t    },\n16\t    \"tables\": [\n17\t      {\n18\t        \"title\": \"Action-Relevant Structure Source Decomposition\",\n19\t        \"columns\": [\n20\t          \"Representation\",\n21\t          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n22\t          \"95% CI\",\n23\t          \"vs DINO\"\n24\t        ],\n25\t        \"rows\": [\n26\t          [\n27\t            \"SigLIP+Projector\",\n28\t            \"0.615\",\n29\t            \"[0.526, 0.695]\",\n30\t            \"+0.227\"\n31\t          ],\n32\t          [\n33\t            \"VLA Trained Peak (L9)\",\n34\t            \"0.488\",\n35\t            \"—\",\n36\t            \"+0.100\"\n37\t          ],\n38\t          [\n39\t            \"VLA Untrained Peak (L12)\",\n40\t            \"0.485\",\n41\t            \"—\",\n42\t            \"+0.097\"\n43\t          ],\n44\t          [\n45\t            \"DINO cls_token\",\n46\t            \"0.388\",\n47\t            \"—\",\n48\t            \"baseline\"\n49\t          ]\n50\t        ]\n51\t      }\n52\t    ],\n53\t    \"figures\": [],\n54\t    \"analysis\": \"Reviewer 共识：frozen encoder dominance 不争议。但 median 档位下 Reviewer 2 可能指出 \\\"LLM degradation\\\" 的措辞过强——LLM 同时在做 instruction routing 和 action computation， RSA 下降可能反映功能转换而非信息丢失。建议用 \\\"geometric reorganization\\\" 替代 \\\"degradation\\\"。 此实验在 rebuttal 中无需调整。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档位下此实验被全部 reviewer 接受（A1 holds）。RSA=0.615 >> VLA 0.488 的 gap 清晰建立了 \\\"vision encoder 是 action-relevant structure 的主要来源\\\" 这一非争议性结论。 但 1 位 reviewer 会注意到这是 RSA metric 下的结论——CKA 下 ordering 不同（plan_009 结果）。 此实验对 C1 framework 贡献最大，不涉及 median 档位的核心争议点（CF metric incomparability）。 CI 较宽 [0.526, 0.695] 会被提及但不作为 major concern，因为 point estimate 远高于 VLA peak。\\n\"\n55\t  },\n56\t  {\n57\t    \"name\": \"DINO standalone baseline\",\n58\t    \"description\": \"DINOv2 baseline RSA — standalone vision model 参照\",\n59\t    \"results\": {\n60\t      \"temporal_distance_rho_pooled\": 0.833,\n61\t      \"per_task_rho_mean\": 0.9008,\n62\t      \"R2\": 0.687,\n63\t      \"subtask_macro_auc\": 0.9717,\n64\t      \"control_b_permutation_rho\": 0.039\n65\t    },\n66\t    \"tables\": [\n67\t      {\n68\t        \"title\": \"DINOv2 Standalone Performance\",\n69\t        \"columns\": [\n70\t          \"Metric\",\n71\t          \"Value\",\n72\t          \"Note\"\n73\t        ],\n74\t        \"rows\": [\n75\t          [\n76\t            \"Temporal ρ (per-task)\",\n77\t            \"0.901\",\n78\t            \"correct baseline\"\n79\t          ],\n80\t          [\n81\t            \"Action Probe R²\",\n82\t            \"0.687\",\n83\t            \"vision-only ceiling\"\n84\t          ],\n85\t          [\n86\t            \"Subtask AUC\",\n87\t            \"0.972\",\n88\t            \"visually distinguishable\"\n89\t          ],\n90\t          [\n91\t            \"Permutation Control ρ\",\n92\t            \"0.039\",\n93\t            \"validates signal\"\n94\t          ]\n95\t        ]\n96\t      }\n97\t    ],\n98\t    \"figures\": [],\n99\t    \"analysis\": \"所有 reviewer 接受。用于建立 DINO < SigLIP < VLA trained 的 ordering baseline。 Median 档位下唯一风险：Reviewer 3 可能质疑 DINOv2 作为 baseline 的 fairness （DINOv2 是 ViT-L/14 1024d vs VLA 4096d），但 dimension mismatch 在 RSA/CKA 中 不是 confound（metric 对 dimensionality invariant）。\\n\\n\\nClean baseline，无争议。DINO RSA=0.388 远低于 VLA 和 projector，建立了 architecture gap。 Subtask AUC=0.97 被 reviewer 接受但会引发 \\\"goals are visually distinguishable\\\" 的注意， 这在后续 goal classification experiments 中成为 confound（10-way classification trivially easy）。 Median 档位下此实验本身不受挑战，但 reviewer 会用它来质疑后续 probe 实验的 discriminability。\\n\"\n100\t  },\n101\t  {\n102\t    \"name\": \"Per-layer RSA degradation curve\",\n103\t    \"description\": \"Per-layer RSA curve — 追踪 RSA 从 projector output 到 LLM 各层的变换轨迹\",\n104\t    \"results\": {\n105\t      \"trained_image_mean_peak_layer\": 9,\n106\t      \"trained_image_mean_peak_rsa\": 0.4876,\n107\t      \"untrained_image_mean_peak_layer\": 12,\n108\t      \"untrained_image_mean_peak_rsa\": 0.4846,\n109\t      \"proj_to_l1_drop_trained\": 0.2036,\n110\t      \"proj_to_l1_drop_untrained\": 0.1512,\n111\t      \"trained_pattern\": \"non_monotonic (inverted-U)\",\n112\t      \"untrained_pattern\": \"non_monotonic\"\n113\t    },\n114\t    \"tables\": [\n115\t      {\n116\t        \"title\": \"Per-Layer RSA Profile Summary\",\n117\t        \"columns\": [\n118\t          \"Condition\",\n119\t          \"Peak Layer\",\n120\t          \"Peak RSA\",\n121\t          \"Proj→L1 Drop\",\n122\t          \"Pattern\"\n123\t        ],\n124\t        \"rows\": [\n125\t          [\n126\t            \"Trained (with inst)\",\n127\t            \"L9\",\n128\t            \"0.488\",\n129\t            \"-0.204\",\n130\t            \"inverted-U\"\n131\t          ],\n132\t          [\n133\t            \"Untrained (with inst)\",\n134\t            \"L12\",\n135\t            \"0.485\",\n136\t            \"-0.151\",\n137\t            \"non-monotonic\"\n138\t          ],\n139\t          [\n140\t            \"Trained (no inst)\",\n141\t            \"L30\",\n142\t            \"0.489\",\n143\t            \"-0.253\",\n144\t            \"increasing\"\n145\t          ],\n146\t          [\n147\t            \"Untrained (no inst)\",\n148\t            \"L6\",\n149\t            \"0.480\",\n150\t            \"-0.137\",\n151\t            \"non-monotonic\"\n152\t          ]\n153\t        ]\n154\t      }\n155\t    ],\n156\t    \"figures\": [],\n157\t    \"analysis\": \"Median 档位 Reviewer 2 的典型批评：\\\"The inverted-U pattern is only demonstrated under RSA.  CKA shows monotonic increase (plan_009), which directly contradicts the 'non-monotonic refinement'  narrative. The authors should either demonstrate metric-robustness or downgrade this to an observation.\\\" Response：承认并降级为 observation。Rebuttal 可补充 R² functional probe 也显示 inverted-U （plan_011），但 reviewer 可能 counter：\\\"R² measures decodability, not geometry — different construct。\\\"\\n\\n\\nInverted-U pattern 是 C3 的核心 evidence。Median 档位下（A3 fails 的延伸）： (1) rise phase Δρ=+0.016 被 1 位 reviewer 认为 negligible（CI includes 0）， inverted-U 的 \\\"rise\\\" 部分可能只是 noise； (2) CKA 下 pattern 完全不同（monotonic），reviewer 质疑 \\\"non-monotonic refinement\\\"  是 metric-specific artifact； (3) decline phase Δρ=-0.206 更 robust，但 reviewer 要求在正文（非 appendix）承认 metric dependence。 最终 C3 作为 \\\"qualified observation under RSA\\\" 存活，但不贡献于 core claims。\\n\"\n158\t  },\n159\t  {\n160\t    \"name\": \"Output head analysis (frozen encoder verification)\",\n161\t    \"description\": \"SigLIP+projector frozen 确认, LLM 权重变化不传导到视觉表征\",\n162\t    \"results\": {\n163\t      \"vision_cos_sim\": 1.0,\n164\t      \"vision_rel_change\": 0.0,\n165\t      \"projector_cos_sim\": 1.001,\n166\t      \"projector_rel_change\": 0.0,\n167\t      \"llm_mean_rel_change\": 1.316,\n168\t      \"llm_range\": [\n169\t        1.22,\n170\t        1.37\n171\t      ],\n172\t      \"head_vs_llm_ratio\": 1.12,\n173\t      \"shallow_adaptation_gate\": \"FAIL (1.12x < 3x threshold)\"\n174\t    },\n175\t    \"tables\": [\n176\t      {\n177\t        \"title\": \"Weight Divergence by Module Group\",\n178\t        \"columns\": [\n179\t          \"Module\",\n180\t          \"Count\",\n181\t          \"Mean Rel Change\",\n182\t          \"Cos Sim\",\n183\t          \"Verdict\"\n184\t        ],\n185\t        \"rows\": [\n186\t          [\n187\t            \"Vision Backbone\",\n188\t            \"685\",\n189\t            \"0.000\",\n190\t            \"1.000\",\n191\t            \"IDENTICAL\"\n192\t          ],\n193\t          [\n194\t            \"Projector\",\n195\t            \"6\",\n196\t            \"0.000\",\n197\t            \"1.001\",\n198\t            \"IDENTICAL\"\n199\t          ],\n200\t          [\n201\t            \"LLM Layers\",\n202\t            \"288\",\n203\t            \"1.316\",\n204\t            \"0.218\",\n205\t            \"DIVERGED\"\n206\t          ],\n207\t          [\n208\t            \"LM Head\",\n209\t            \"1\",\n210\t            \"1.475\",\n211\t            \"0.000\",\n212\t            \"DIVERGED\"\n213\t          ],\n214\t          [\n215\t            \"Embedding\",\n216\t            \"1\",\n217\t            \"1.329\",\n218\t            \"-0.000\",\n219\t            \"DIVERGED\"\n220\t          ]\n221\t        ]\n222\t      }\n223\t    ],\n224\t    \"figures\": [],\n225\t    \"analysis\": \"全部 reviewer 接受。此实验为 C1 framework 提供了必要的 architectural verification。 Median 档位下无额外挑战。但 Reviewer 1 可能在 minor comments 中建议 \\\"clarify that  untrained = random init, not ablated weights\\\" 以避免读者误解。\\n\\n\\n此实验确认 vision backbone + projector 在 trained 和 untrained 之间完全一致（cos_sim=1.0）， 解释了为什么 RSA 在 image_mean tokens 上 trained ≈ untrained。Median 档位下被接受 （A1 holds），但 reviewer 注意到 caveat：\\\"comparison is pretrained Llama vs random init,  not pre/post fine-tuning\\\"，这限制了 interpretability。LLM weights uniformly distributed （ratio=1.12x）否定了 shallow adaptation hypothesis——head 不特殊。 此实验支持 C1 framework 的 \\\"frozen encoder\\\" 前提，不涉及 median 档位的争议点。\\n\"\n226\t  },\n227\t  {\n228\t    \"name\": \"6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks (orphaned)\",\n229\t    \"description\": \"系统性验证 trained ≈ untrained across 6 methods\",\n230\t    \"results\": {\n231\t      \"status\": \"orphaned\",\n232\t      \"conclusion\": \"All 6 methods consistent: trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\",\n233\t      \"note\": \"被后续更精细的实验取代（plan_011 fulllayer R², d041 definitive RSA, etc.）\"\n234\t    },\n235\t    \"tables\": [],\n236\t    \"figures\": [],\n237\t    \"analysis\": \"Orphaned，不进入论文。但其结论（trained ≈ untrained）被 plan_007 和 d041 复现， 成为 C3 \\\"observation\\\" 而非 \\\"finding\\\" 的证据基础。\\n\\n\\n此实验在 Phase 1 被 orphaned，其核心结论（trained ≈ untrained in RSA/R²）被后续实验 独立复现。在 median 档位下不直接贡献，但其 \\\"trained ≈ untrained\\\" 的 RSA 结论正是 reviewer 用来质疑 \\\"training effect\\\" narrative 的弹药之一——如果 training 不改变 RSA， 那 training 到底做了什么？Answer 在 C2（routing reorganization），但 reviewer 可能认为 证据不够 conclusive without behavioral validation（A4 partially fails）。\\n\"\n238\t  },\n239\t  {\n240\t    \"name\": \"Instruction ablation RSA\",\n241\t    \"description\": \"去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化\",\n242\t    \"results\": {\n243\t      \"with_inst_untrained_peak_rsa\": 0.4846,\n244\t      \"no_inst_untrained_peak_rsa\": 0.4802,\n245\t      \"delta\": 0.0044,\n246\t      \"gate_threshold\": 0.1,\n247\t      \"gate_judgment\": \"FAIL — Δ=0.004 << 0.10\"\n248\t    },\n249\t    \"tables\": [\n250\t      {\n251\t        \"title\": \"Instruction Ablation Effect on RSA\",\n252\t        \"columns\": [\n253\t          \"Condition\",\n254\t          \"Peak RSA\",\n255\t          \"Δ vs with-inst\"\n256\t        ],\n257\t        \"rows\": [\n258\t          [\n259\t            \"Untrained + instruction\",\n260\t            \"0.485\",\n261\t            \"baseline\"\n262\t          ],\n263\t          [\n264\t            \"Untrained − instruction\",\n265\t            \"0.480\",\n266\t            \"-0.004\"\n267\t          ],\n268\t          [\n269\t            \"Threshold for significance\",\n270\t            \"—\",\n271\t            \"0.10\"\n272\t          ],\n273\t          [\n274\t            \"DINO baseline\",\n275\t            \"0.388\",\n276\t            \"—\"\n277\t          ]\n278\t        ]\n279\t      }\n280\t    ],\n281\t    \"figures\": [],\n282\t    \"analysis\": \"Reviewer 接受。此 negative result 实际强化了 C1：image tokens 的 action-relevant  geometry 来自 visual content，instruction presence 不影响。但 median 档位下  Reviewer 2 会追问：\\\"if instruction doesn't matter for image tokens, what exactly  does VLA training change?\\\" — 这个问题的答案在 C2（routing at instruction token positions）， 但需要更清晰的 framing。\\n\\n\\nNegative result：移除 instruction 对 image token RSA 几乎无影响（Δ=0.004 << 0.10）。 这证明了 action-relevant structure 是 vision-driven 而非 instruction-driven。 Median 档位下此结论被接受（支持 C1 \\\"image tokens 不 attend to instructions\\\" 的验证）， 但 reviewer 可能指出：这只说明 image_mean RSA 不依赖 instruction，不能推广到 last_preaction tokens（C2 的核心 readout position）。实际上 last_preaction 的 routing 完全依赖 instruction（cross-instruction probe 100%），两个 readout 位置的 independence pattern 不同——这本身是一个 finding，但需要在论文中明确区分。\\n\"\n283\t  },\n284\t  {\n285\t    \"name\": \"2×2 training × instruction matrix\",\n286\t    \"description\": \"四条件全收敛验证 — trained/untrained × with/without instruction\",\n287\t    \"results\": {\n288\t      \"trained_with_inst\": 0.4876,\n289\t      \"trained_no_inst\": 0.489,\n290\t      \"untrained_with_inst\": 0.4846,\n291\t      \"untrained_no_inst\": 0.4802,\n292\t      \"bootstrap_delta_ci\": \"[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0\",\n293\t      \"max_pairwise_delta\": 0.0088,\n294\t      \"dino_baseline\": 0.388\n295\t    },\n296\t    \"tables\": [\n297\t      {\n298\t        \"title\": \"2×2 Factorial Design: RSA Convergence\",\n299\t        \"columns\": [\n300\t          \"\",\n301\t          \"With Instruction\",\n302\t          \"Without Instruction\",\n303\t          \"Instruction Effect\"\n304\t        ],\n305\t        \"rows\": [\n306\t          [\n307\t            \"Trained\",\n308\t            \"0.488\",\n309\t            \"0.489\",\n310\t            \"-0.001\"\n311\t          ],\n312\t          [\n313\t            \"Untrained\",\n314\t            \"0.485\",\n315\t            \"0.480\",\n316\t            \"+0.004\"\n317\t          ],\n318\t          [\n319\t            \"Training Effect\",\n320\t            \"+0.003\",\n321\t            \"+0.009\",\n322\t            \"—\"\n323\t          ]\n324\t        ]\n325\t      }\n326\t    ],\n327\t    \"figures\": [],\n328\t    \"analysis\": \"Median 档位的关键 pivot point。此实验的 \\\"null result\\\"（4 条件无差异）在 median  scenario 下被部分 reviewer 视为 limitation：\\\"if your framework can't detect training  effects in RSA, perhaps RSA is the wrong metric。\\\" 这直接导致 C3 从 core claim  降为 observation。Rebuttal 需要论证：RSA invariance + R² divergence = geometry-function  dissociation，这本身是 interesting，但需要 behavioral evidence 来确认 functional significance。\\n\\n\\n2×2 matrix 所有 4 cells 收敛在 0.480-0.489 的窄带中，bootstrap CI 包含 0。 这是 C3 \\\"instruction invariance\\\" observation 的定量基础。Median 档位下被接受 但 reviewer 的解读分歧： - Reviewer 1：接受，认为 \\\"vision encoder geometry dominates\\\" 是 clean result - Reviewer 2：认为这意味着 \\\"neither training nor instruction has meaningful effect \\n  on image token geometry\\\"，进而质疑论文的 novelty——如果训练不改变 RSA，论文需要\\n  更强地论证 routing/R² 变化的意义\\n- Reviewer 3：接受，但要求将此与 C2 的 exit collapse（R² 层面的变化）明确对比——\\n  RSA 不变但 R² 变化说明 \\\"geometry preserved but decodability reorganized\\\"\\n\"\n329\t  },\n330\t  {\n331\t    \"name\": \"Random instruction control (content invariance)\",\n332\t    \"description\": \"用 random/shuffled/empty instruction 替代真实 instruction 测 RSA 变化\",\n333\t    \"results\": {\n334\t      \"normal_peak_rsa\": 0.4888,\n335\t      \"random_peak_rsa\": 0.4835,\n336\t      \"shuffled_peak_rsa\": 0.4832,\n337\t      \"empty_peak_rsa\": 0.4723,\n338\t      \"max_absolute_delta\": 0.0165,\n339\t      \"instruction_invariant\": true\n340\t    },\n341\t    \"tables\": [\n342\t      {\n343\t        \"title\": \"Instruction Content Invariance (Trained Model)\",\n344\t        \"columns\": [\n345\t          \"Instruction Type\",\n346\t          \"Peak RSA\",\n347\t          \"Δ vs Normal\"\n348\t        ],\n349\t        \"rows\": [\n350\t          [\n351\t            \"Normal (correct)\",\n352\t            \"0.489\",\n353\t            \"baseline\"\n354\t          ],\n355\t          [\n356\t            \"Random tokens\",\n357\t            \"0.484\",\n358\t            \"-0.005\"\n359\t          ],\n360\t          [\n361\t            \"Shuffled words\",\n362\t            \"0.483\",\n363\t            \"-0.006\"\n364\t          ],\n365\t          [\n366\t            \"Empty string\",\n367\t            \"0.472\",\n368\t            \"-0.017\"\n369\t          ]\n370\t        ]\n371\t      }\n372\t    ],\n373\t    \"figures\": [],\n374\t    \"analysis\": \"Uncontroversial control。所有 reviewer 认为此实验 demonstrates thoroughness。 Median 档位下唯一 minor concern：empty string Δ=-0.017 是 4 条件中最大的， 暗示 instruction presence 有微弱效应（token count/position effect），但远低于 threshold。\\n\\n\\n三重不变性完备验证：training invariance（plan_007）+ instruction presence invariance （plan_006）+ instruction content invariance（此实验）。所有 delta < 0.017。 Median 档位下被全部 reviewer 接受为 thorough control。这实际上强化了 C1 framework 的可信度——image token geometry 对 instruction content 完全不敏感。 但 reviewer 会对比 counterfactual sensitivity results（C2-X CF）：image tokens 对 instruction invariant，但 instruction/last_preaction tokens 高度 sensitive（d≥0.45）。 这个 dissociation 本身是 interesting，但在 median 档位下被认为 \\\"consistent with  causal mask — not surprising。\\\"\\n\"\n375\t  },\n376\t  {\n377\t    \"name\": \"CKA verification (metric robustness)\",\n378\t    \"description\": \"用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，确保不是指标依赖\",\n379\t    \"results\": {\n380\t      \"linear_cka_ordering\": \"untrained > trained > projector > DINO\",\n381\t      \"rdm_cka_ordering\": \"trained > projector > untrained > DINO\",\n382\t      \"rsa_ordering\": \"projector >> trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\",\n383\t      \"cka_reversal_detected\": true,\n384\t      \"dino_lowest_robust\": true,\n385\t      \"last_preaction_highest\": 0.127\n386\t    },\n387\t    \"tables\": [\n388\t      {\n389\t        \"title\": \"RSA vs CKA Metric Comparison\",\n390\t        \"columns\": [\n391\t          \"Representation\",\n392\t          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n393\t          \"Linear CKA\",\n394\t          \"RDM-CKA\",\n395\t          \"Consistent?\"\n396\t        ],\n397\t        \"rows\": [\n398\t          [\n399\t            \"SigLIP Projector\",\n400\t            \"0.615\",\n401\t            \"0.081\",\n402\t            \"0.257\",\n403\t            \"No — RSA >> CKA\"\n404\t          ],\n405\t          [\n406\t            \"VLA Trained (img_mean)\",\n407\t            \"0.488\",\n408\t            \"0.083\",\n409\t            \"0.260\",\n410\t            \"No\"\n411\t          ],\n412\t          [\n413\t            \"VLA Untrained (img_mean)\",\n414\t            \"0.485\",\n415\t            \"0.089\",\n416\t            \"0.246\",\n417\t            \"No — CKA reversal\"\n418\t          ],\n419\t          [\n420\t            \"DINO cls_token\",\n421\t            \"0.388\",\n422\t            \"0.066\",\n423\t            \"0.241\",\n424\t            \"Yes — lowest in all\"\n425\t          ],\n426\t          [\n427\t            \"VLA Trained (last_pre)\",\n428\t            \"—\",\n429\t            \"0.127\",\n430\t            \"0.290\",\n431\t            \"Highest in CKA\"\n432\t          ]\n433\t        ]\n434\t      }\n435\t    ],\n436\t    \"figures\": [],\n437\t    \"analysis\": \"Median 档位核心 attack surface。Reviewer 2 的典型评论： \\\"The RSA-CKA dissociation undermines confidence in the geometric interpretation.  The authors claim 'non-monotonic refinement' based on RSA, but CKA shows monotonic  structure. This metric dependence should be acknowledged as a fundamental limitation,  not relegated to an appendix.\\\" Rebuttal 策略：承认 dissociation，将 C3 降为 \\\"observation under RSA\\\"，强调 C2 （exit collapse, routing）基于 R² functional probe，不依赖 RSA/CKA 选择。 Reviewer acceptance for C3 drops to ~0.4，但 C2 不受影响（~0.75）。\\n\\n\\n这是 median 档位的关键 problematic experiment。CKA ordering 与 RSA 反转—— CKA 下 untrained > trained（RSA 下 trained ≈ untrained），projector 不再最高。 这直接导致： (1) C3 的 \\\"non-monotonic refinement\\\" 仅在 RSA 下成立，metric-dependent； (2) DINOv2 \\\"highest geometric foundation\\\" 仅在 RSA 下成立； (3) 1-2 位 reviewer 认为 RSA 结果不可推广。 但 DINO 在所有 metrics 下均最低（robust），且 last_preaction >> image_mean 的 redistribution pattern 在 CKA 下也成立。 A2 partially 的表现：exit collapse 主要基于 R²（functional metric），不依赖 RSA/CKA， 所以 exit collapse 本身不受 CKA reversal 影响。但 C3 vision encoder geometry claim  被严重 undercut。\\n\"\n438\t  },\n439\t  {\n440\t    \"name\": \"LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark replication\",\n441\t    \"description\": \"第三个 benchmark 交叉验证 RSA inverted-U 和 R² patterns\",\n442\t    \"results\": {\n443\t      \"rsa_trained_img_peak\": {\n444\t        \"layer\": 14,\n445\t        \"rsa\": 0.691\n446\t      },\n447\t      \"rsa_trained_lastpre_peak\": {\n448\t        \"layer\": 15,\n449\t        \"rsa\": 0.695\n450\t      },\n451\t      \"rsa_untrained_img_peak\": {\n452\t        \"layer\": 0,\n453\t        \"rsa\": 0.652\n454\t      },\n455\t      \"r2_trained_img_peak\": {\n456\t        \"layer\": 13,\n457\t        \"R2\": 0.696\n458\t      },\n459\t      \"r2_trained_lastpre_peak\": {\n460\t        \"layer\": 21,\n461\t        \"R2\": 0.675\n462\t      },\n463\t      \"r2_untrained_img_peak\": {\n464\t        \"layer\": 0,\n465\t        \"R2\": 0.673\n466\t      },\n467\t      \"bootstrap_p\": \"<0.001 for all trained vs untrained\",\n468\t      \"cross_benchmark_consistency\": \"high — peak layers within 2-layer range\"\n469\t    },\n470\t    \"tables\": [\n471\t      {\n472\t        \"title\": \"Cross-Benchmark Replication (Goal vs Spatial)\",\n473\t        \"columns\": [\n474\t          \"Metric\",\n475\t          \"Goal Peak\",\n476\t          \"Spatial Peak\",\n477\t          \"Δ Layers\"\n478\t        ],\n479\t        \"rows\": [\n480\t          [\n481\t            \"RSA trained img_mean\",\n482\t            \"L12 (0.628)\",\n483\t            \"L14 (0.691)\",\n484\t            \"+2\"\n485\t          ],\n486\t          [\n487\t            \"RSA trained last_pre\",\n488\t            \"L12 (0.643)\",\n489\t            \"L15 (0.695)\",\n490\t            \"+3\"\n491\t          ],\n492\t          [\n493\t            \"R² trained img_mean\",\n494\t            \"L8 (0.655)\",\n495\t            \"L13 (0.696)\",\n496\t            \"+5\"\n497\t          ],\n498\t          [\n499\t            \"R² trained last_pre\",\n500\t            \"L13 (0.678)\",\n501\t            \"L21 (0.675)\",\n502\t            \"+8\"\n503\t          ]\n504\t        ]\n505\t      }\n506\t    ],\n507\t    \"figures\": [],\n508\t    \"analysis\": \"Reviewer 接受 cross-benchmark replication。Median 档位下 Reviewer 1 可能评价： \\\"Good that patterns replicate across task suites, but both are within the same  model (OpenVLA). The cross-architecture validation (TracVLA, NORA) is more convincing  for the generalization claim.\\\" 此实验对 A1 holds 贡献但不是 decisive。\\n\\n\\nLIBERO-Spatial 复现了 LIBERO-Goal 的所有核心 patterns：trained inverted-U,  untrained flat/declining, bootstrap significant。Peak layers 一致（Goal L8-L13,  Spatial L13-L21）。Median 档位下此实验强化了 within-OpenVLA 的 reproducibility， 被 reviewer 接受。但 reviewer 会注意到： (1) 仍然是同一架构（OpenVLA），跨架构验证更重要（D088-D094 addresses this）； (2) RSA inverted-U 的 rise phase 在 Spatial 中 Δρ=0.039（Goal 中 0.016）， 略更 robust 但仍在 metric-dependent 的质疑范围内。\\n\"\n509\t  },\n510\t  {\n511\t    \"name\": \"Full-layer R² scan (132 probes)\",\n512\t    \"description\": \"33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations — R² per-layer curve 验证 exit collapse\",\n513\t    \"results\": {\n514\t      \"trained_image_mean_peak\": {\n515\t        \"layer\": 8,\n516\t        \"R2\": 0.6553\n517\t      },\n518\t      \"trained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n519\t        \"layer\": 13,\n520\t        \"R2\": 0.6779\n521\t      },\n522\t      \"untrained_image_mean_peak\": {\n523\t        \"layer\": 0,\n524\t        \"R2\": 0.6403\n525\t      },\n526\t      \"untrained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n527\t        \"layer\": 32,\n528\t        \"R2\": 0.6093\n529\t      },\n530\t      \"bootstrap_best_vs_best_imgmean\": {\n531\t        \"delta\": 0.015,\n532\t        \"p\": 0.006\n533\t      },\n534\t      \"bootstrap_best_vs_best_lastpre\": {\n535\t        \"delta\": 0.069,\n536\t        \"p\": 0.0001\n537\t      },\n538\t      \"untrained_L10_L13_collapse\": \"R² near -0.33 (pathological)\"\n539\t    },\n540\t    \"tables\": [\n541\t      {\n542\t        \"title\": \"R² Peak-Exit Comparison (OpenVLA, LIBERO-Goal)\",\n543\t        \"columns\": [\n544\t          \"Condition\",\n545\t          \"Peak Layer\",\n546\t          \"Peak R²\",\n547\t          \"Exit R²\",\n548\t          \"Δ(peak-exit)\"\n549\t        ],\n550\t        \"rows\": [\n551\t          [\n552\t            \"Trained img_mean\",\n553\t            \"L8\",\n554\t            \"0.655\",\n555\t            \"0.520\",\n556\t            \"0.135\"\n557\t          ],\n558\t          [\n559\t            \"Trained last_pre\",\n560\t            \"L13\",\n561\t            \"0.678\",\n562\t            \"0.609\",\n563\t            \"0.069\"\n564\t          ],\n565\t          [\n566\t            \"Untrained img_mean\",\n567\t            \"L0\",\n568\t            \"0.640\",\n569\t            \"0.584\",\n570\t            \"0.056\"\n571\t          ],\n572\t          [\n573\t            \"Untrained last_pre\",\n574\t            \"L32\",\n575\t            \"0.609\",\n576\t            \"0.609\",\n577\t            \"0.000\"\n578\t          ]\n579\t        ]\n580\t      },\n581\t      {\n582\t        \"title\": \"Bootstrap Statistical Comparison\",\n583\t        \"columns\": [\n584\t          \"Comparison\",\n585\t          \"Δ R²\",\n586\t          \"p-value\",\n587\t          \"Significant?\"\n588\t        ],\n589\t        \"rows\": [\n590\t          [\n591\t            \"Best-vs-best img_mean\",\n592\t            \"+0.015\",\n593\t            \"0.006\",\n594\t            \"Yes\"\n595\t          ],\n596\t          [\n597\t            \"Best-vs-best last_pre\",\n598\t            \"+0.069\",\n599\t            \"<0.0001\",\n600\t            \"Yes\"\n601\t          ],\n602\t          [\n603\t            \"Same-layer L8 img_mean\",\n604\t            \"+0.123\",\n605\t            \"<0.0001\",\n606\t            \"Yes\"\n607\t          ],\n608\t          [\n609\t            \"Same-layer L13 last_pre\",\n610\t            \"+1.007\",\n611\t            \"<0.0001\",\n612\t            \"Yes (collapsed)\"\n613\t          ]\n614\t        ]\n615\t      }\n616\t    ],\n617\t    \"figures\": [],\n618\t    \"analysis\": \"Median 档位核心争议之一。Reviewer 3 的典型 comment： \\\"The Δ>0.10 threshold for 'substantial' exit collapse appears arbitrary. At this  threshold, OpenVLA shows collapse only for image_mean (Δ=0.135) but not last_preaction  (Δ=0.069). The authors should provide a principled justification or show that  conclusions hold across a range of thresholds.\\\"\\nRebuttal strategy：补充 sensitivity analysis showing pattern stability at 0.05/0.10/0.15。 At Δ>0.05：VLM→VLA 仍然 6/6，VLA→VLA 变为 2/4（Goal Δ=0.086 > 0.05）。 At Δ>0.15：VLM→VLA 仍然 5/6（TracVLA Spatial Δ=0.138 borderline）。 二元分离（VLM→VLA vs VLA→VLA）在所有阈值下基本 stable。\\n\\n\\n此实验是 C2 exit collapse 的 foundational evidence（OpenVLA 内部）。 Trained last_preaction 显示经典 inverted-U：L13 peak 0.678 → L32 exit 0.609（Δ=0.069）。 Untrained 则 L10-L13 完全 collapse（R² ≈ -0.33），仅 L32 恢复到 0.609。\\nMedian 档位下（A2 partially）： - Exit collapse pattern 被接受（3/4 reviewers） - 但 Reviewer 3 质疑 Δ>0.10 阈值的 principled justification：为什么不是 0.05 或 0.15？\\n  这个阈值是 ad hoc 还是有统计或领域基础？\\n- Rebuttal 需要补充 sensitivity analysis：在 0.05/0.10/0.15 三个阈值下 pattern 是否稳定\\n注意：OpenVLA 的 R² exit Δ 在 v3 MCCV 修正后仅 0.033-0.086（VLA→VLA transition）， 低于 0.10 阈值。真正的 exit collapse 来自 TracVLA/NORA（VLM→VLA transition, Δ=0.156-0.455）。 此实验建立了 baseline expectation，但 median 档位下 reviewer 会质疑 threshold choice。\\n\"\n619\t  },\n620\t  {\n621\t    \"name\": \"CLIP-ViT pretraining control\",\n622\t    \"description\": \"CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 贡献 vs encoder quality\",\n623\t    \"results\": {\n624\t      \"projector_R2\": 0.6298,\n625\t      \"dino_cls_R2\": 0.6343,\n626\t      \"clip_cls_R2\": 0.5866,\n627\t      \"vla_image_mean_L19_R2\": 0.5986,\n628\t      \"vla_last_preaction_L19_R2\": 0.6711,\n629\t      \"ordering\": \"last_pre > dino_cls ≈ projector > vla_img_mean > clip_cls\",\n630\t      \"clip_vs_dino_p\": 0.0\n631\t    },\n632\t    \"tables\": [\n633\t      {\n634\t        \"title\": \"Cross-Encoder Action Probe R² (Unified Hyperparams)\",\n635\t        \"columns\": [\n636\t          \"Encoder\",\n637\t          \"Pretraining\",\n638\t          \"R²\",\n639\t          \"vs Projector p\"\n640\t        ],\n641\t        \"rows\": [\n642\t          [\n643\t            \"VLA last_pre L19\",\n644\t            \"VLA fine-tuned\",\n645\t            \"0.671\",\n646\t            \"0.002\"\n647\t          ],\n648\t          [\n649\t            \"DINO cls_token\",\n650\t            \"Self-supervised\",\n651\t            \"0.634\",\n652\t            \"0.557 (n.s.)\"\n653\t          ],\n654\t          [\n655\t            \"SigLIP+Projector\",\n656\t            \"VL + projection\",\n657\t            \"0.630\",\n658\t            \"baseline\"\n659\t          ],\n660\t          [\n661\t            \"VLA img_mean L19\",\n662\t            \"VLA fine-tuned\",\n663\t            \"0.599\",\n664\t            \"<0.001\"\n665\t          ],\n666\t          [\n667\t            \"CLIP cls_token\",\n668\t            \"VL contrastive\",\n669\t            \"0.587\",\n670\t            \"<0.001\"\n671\t          ]\n672\t        ]\n673\t      }\n674\t    ],\n675\t    \"figures\": [],\n676\t    \"analysis\": \"Clean result，全部 reviewer 接受。Median 档位下此实验的贡献是 \\\"supporting evidence  for C3 vision encoder geometry observation\\\"——DINOv2 ranking under RSA 在 functional  probe 中也 partially replicated（DINO R² ≈ Projector R²）。但 CKA reversal（plan_009） 仍然 undermines 跨 metric generalizability。\\n\\n\\nCLIP < DINO 在 RSA 和 R² 下均成立，否定了 \\\"VL pretraining dominance\\\" hypothesis。 Self-supervised (DINOv2) 比 VL pretrained (CLIP) 更好地 capture action-relevant structure。 Median 档位下此结果被接受，但 Reviewer 1 可能质疑： (1) CLIP ViT-L 和 DINOv2 ViT-L 是不同的 architecture variants，不能 solely \\n    attribute to pretraining difference；\\n(2) SigLIP（OpenVLA 的实际 encoder）是 VL pretrained 但 RSA=0.615 > DINO=0.631，\\n    矛盾——但这通过 plan_013 branch split 解释（fused backbone 中 DINOv2 和 SigLIP \\n    贡献 equally）。\\n\"\n677\t  },\n678\t  {\n679\t    \"name\": \"Branch-split RSA (DINOv2 vs SigLIP in fused backbone)\",\n680\t    \"description\": \"分离 DinoSigLIP fused backbone 中 DINOv2 branch vs SigLIP branch 的 RSA 贡献\",\n681\t    \"results\": {\n682\t      \"dinov2_branch_rsa\": 0.619,\n683\t      \"siglip_branch_rsa\": 0.621,\n684\t      \"fused_2176d_rsa\": 0.634,\n685\t      \"post_projector_4096d_rsa\": 0.615,\n686\t      \"standalone_dino_cls_rsa\": 0.692,\n687\t      \"standalone_dino_patch_mean_rsa\": 0.631\n688\t    },\n689\t    \"tables\": [\n690\t      {\n691\t        \"title\": \"Fused Backbone Branch Decomposition\",\n692\t        \"columns\": [\n693\t          \"Component\",\n694\t          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n695\t          \"Dim\",\n696\t          \"Note\"\n697\t        ],\n698\t        \"rows\": [\n699\t          [\n700\t            \"DINOv2 branch\",\n701\t            \"0.619\",\n702\t            \"1088\",\n703\t            \"in-backbone\"\n704\t          ],\n705\t          [\n706\t            \"SigLIP branch\",\n707\t            \"0.621\",\n708\t            \"1088\",\n709\t            \"in-backbone\"\n710\t          ],\n711\t          [\n712\t            \"Fused backbone\",\n713\t            \"0.634\",\n714\t            \"2176\",\n715\t            \"before projection\"\n716\t          ],\n717\t          [\n718\t            \"Post-projector\",\n719\t            \"0.615\",\n720\t            \"4096\",\n721\t            \"LLM input\"\n722\t          ],\n723\t          [\n724\t            \"Standalone DINO cls\",\n725\t            \"0.692\",\n726\t            \"1024\",\n727\t            \"different layer\"\n728\t          ]\n729\t        ]\n730\t      }\n731\t    ],\n732\t    \"figures\": [],\n733\t    \"analysis\": \"Median 档位下所有 reviewer 接受。此实验的价值在 median scenario 下有限—— C3 已降为 observation，branch-split 的精细分解不会改变 reviewer 对 core claims 的评估。 但它 demonstrates thoroughness，可能为 reviewer 1 的正面评价贡献 \\\"well-executed experimental design\\\"。 Reviewer 3 可能在 minor comments 中建议 \\\"move branch-split analysis to supplementary  to save main text space for the cross-architecture results which are more impactful。\\\"\\n\\nDINOv2 ≈ SigLIP（Δ < 0.002）在 fused backbone 中贡献 equally。 Fused > either branch（complementary benefit）。Projector 从 0.634 压缩到 0.615。 Median 档位下此实验被接受为 clean decomposition： - Reviewer 接受 \\\"both branches contribute equally\\\" 的结论 - 但注意到 standalone DINO cls (0.692) > in-backbone DINOv2 branch (0.619)，\\n  差距可能来自 extraction layer difference（standalone = last layer，\\n  in-backbone = fused intermediate）——这不是 meaningful comparison\\n- 此实验支持 C3 但 C3 已降为 observation，所以贡献有限\\n\"\n734\t  }\n735\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8cbcf4e7-d931-4ca2-8268-57735c3f5142","uuid":"2f5d7902-5408-421b-9c01-bdd319b32acf","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:05:23.692Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260527T022433/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SigLIP+Projector RSA baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO — 证明 action-relevant 结构源自 frozen vision encoder\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"siglip_projector_rsa\": 0.6153,\n      \"bootstrap_95_ci\": [\n        0.5257,\n        0.6954\n      ],\n      \"trained_vla_peak_rsa\": 0.4876,\n      \"untrained_vla_peak_rsa\": 0.4846,\n      \"dino_rsa\": 0.388,\n      \"llm_degradation_magnitude\": 0.127\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Action-Relevant Structure Source Decomposition\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Representation\",\n          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"vs DINO\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SigLIP+Projector\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"[0.526, 0.695]\",\n            \"+0.227\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA Trained Peak (L9)\",\n            \"0.488\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"+0.100\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA Untrained Peak (L12)\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"+0.097\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DINO cls_token\",\n            \"0.388\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"baseline\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Reviewer 共识：frozen encoder dominance 不争议。但 median 档位下 Reviewer 2 可能指出 \\\"LLM degradation\\\" 的措辞过强——LLM 同时在做 instruction routing 和 action computation， RSA 下降可能反映功能转换而非信息丢失。建议用 \\\"geometric reorganization\\\" 替代 \\\"degradation\\\"。 此实验在 rebuttal 中无需调整。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档位下此实验被全部 reviewer 接受（A1 holds）。RSA=0.615 >> VLA 0.488 的 gap 清晰建立了 \\\"vision encoder 是 action-relevant structure 的主要来源\\\" 这一非争议性结论。 但 1 位 reviewer 会注意到这是 RSA metric 下的结论——CKA 下 ordering 不同（plan_009 结果）。 此实验对 C1 framework 贡献最大，不涉及 median 档位的核心争议点（CF metric incomparability）。 CI 较宽 [0.526, 0.695] 会被提及但不作为 major concern，因为 point estimate 远高于 VLA peak。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DINO standalone baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"DINOv2 baseline RSA — standalone vision model 参照\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"temporal_distance_rho_pooled\": 0.833,\n      \"per_task_rho_mean\": 0.9008,\n      \"R2\": 0.687,\n      \"subtask_macro_auc\": 0.9717,\n      \"control_b_permutation_rho\": 0.039\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"DINOv2 Standalone Performance\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Value\",\n          \"Note\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Temporal ρ (per-task)\",\n            \"0.901\",\n            \"correct baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Action Probe R²\",\n            \"0.687\",\n            \"vision-only ceiling\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Subtask AUC\",\n            \"0.972\",\n            \"visually distinguishable\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Permutation Control ρ\",\n            \"0.039\",\n            \"validates signal\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"所有 reviewer 接受。用于建立 DINO < SigLIP < VLA trained 的 ordering baseline。 Median 档位下唯一风险：Reviewer 3 可能质疑 DINOv2 作为 baseline 的 fairness （DINOv2 是 ViT-L/14 1024d vs VLA 4096d），但 dimension mismatch 在 RSA/CKA 中 不是 confound（metric 对 dimensionality invariant）。\\n\\n\\nClean baseline，无争议。DINO RSA=0.388 远低于 VLA 和 projector，建立了 architecture gap。 Subtask AUC=0.97 被 reviewer 接受但会引发 \\\"goals are visually distinguishable\\\" 的注意， 这在后续 goal classification experiments 中成为 confound（10-way classification trivially easy）。 Median 档位下此实验本身不受挑战，但 reviewer 会用它来质疑后续 probe 实验的 discriminability。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Per-layer RSA degradation curve\",\n    \"description\": \"Per-layer RSA curve — 追踪 RSA 从 projector output 到 LLM 各层的变换轨迹\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"trained_image_mean_peak_layer\": 9,\n      \"trained_image_mean_peak_rsa\": 0.4876,\n      \"untrained_image_mean_peak_layer\": 12,\n      \"untrained_image_mean_peak_rsa\": 0.4846,\n      \"proj_to_l1_drop_trained\": 0.2036,\n      \"proj_to_l1_drop_untrained\": 0.1512,\n      \"trained_pattern\": \"non_monotonic (inverted-U)\",\n      \"untrained_pattern\": \"non_monotonic\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Per-Layer RSA Profile Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Peak Layer\",\n          \"Peak RSA\",\n          \"Proj→L1 Drop\",\n          \"Pattern\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Trained (with inst)\",\n            \"L9\",\n            \"0.488\",\n            \"-0.204\",\n            \"inverted-U\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained (with inst)\",\n            \"L12\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"-0.151\",\n            \"non-monotonic\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trained (no inst)\",\n            \"L30\",\n            \"0.489\",\n            \"-0.253\",\n            \"increasing\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained (no inst)\",\n            \"L6\",\n            \"0.480\",\n            \"-0.137\",\n            \"non-monotonic\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median 档位 Reviewer 2 的典型批评：\\\"The inverted-U pattern is only demonstrated under RSA.  CKA shows monotonic increase (plan_009), which directly contradicts the 'non-monotonic refinement'  narrative. The authors should either demonstrate metric-robustness or downgrade this to an observation.\\\" Response：承认并降级为 observation。Rebuttal 可补充 R² functional probe 也显示 inverted-U （plan_011），但 reviewer 可能 counter：\\\"R² measures decodability, not geometry — different construct。\\\"\\n\\n\\nInverted-U pattern 是 C3 的核心 evidence。Median 档位下（A3 fails 的延伸）： (1) rise phase Δρ=+0.016 被 1 位 reviewer 认为 negligible（CI includes 0）， inverted-U 的 \\\"rise\\\" 部分可能只是 noise； (2) CKA 下 pattern 完全不同（monotonic），reviewer 质疑 \\\"non-monotonic refinement\\\"  是 metric-specific artifact； (3) decline phase Δρ=-0.206 更 robust，但 reviewer 要求在正文（非 appendix）承认 metric dependence。 最终 C3 作为 \\\"qualified observation under RSA\\\" 存活，但不贡献于 core claims。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Output head analysis (frozen encoder verification)\",\n    \"description\": \"SigLIP+projector frozen 确认, LLM 权重变化不传导到视觉表征\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"vision_cos_sim\": 1.0,\n      \"vision_rel_change\": 0.0,\n      \"projector_cos_sim\": 1.001,\n      \"projector_rel_change\": 0.0,\n      \"llm_mean_rel_change\": 1.316,\n      \"llm_range\": [\n        1.22,\n        1.37\n      ],\n      \"head_vs_llm_ratio\": 1.12,\n      \"shallow_adaptation_gate\": \"FAIL (1.12x < 3x threshold)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Weight Divergence by Module Group\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Module\",\n          \"Count\",\n          \"Mean Rel Change\",\n          \"Cos Sim\",\n          \"Verdict\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Vision Backbone\",\n            \"685\",\n            \"0.000\",\n            \"1.000\",\n            \"IDENTICAL\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Projector\",\n            \"6\",\n            \"0.000\",\n            \"1.001\",\n            \"IDENTICAL\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LLM Layers\",\n            \"288\",\n            \"1.316\",\n            \"0.218\",\n            \"DIVERGED\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LM Head\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"1.475\",\n            \"0.000\",\n            \"DIVERGED\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Embedding\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"1.329\",\n            \"-0.000\",\n            \"DIVERGED\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"全部 reviewer 接受。此实验为 C1 framework 提供了必要的 architectural verification。 Median 档位下无额外挑战。但 Reviewer 1 可能在 minor comments 中建议 \\\"clarify that  untrained = random init, not ablated weights\\\" 以避免读者误解。\\n\\n\\n此实验确认 vision backbone + projector 在 trained 和 untrained 之间完全一致（cos_sim=1.0）， 解释了为什么 RSA 在 image_mean tokens 上 trained ≈ untrained。Median 档位下被接受 （A1 holds），但 reviewer 注意到 caveat：\\\"comparison is pretrained Llama vs random init,  not pre/post fine-tuning\\\"，这限制了 interpretability。LLM weights uniformly distributed （ratio=1.12x）否定了 shallow adaptation hypothesis——head 不特殊。 此实验支持 C1 framework 的 \\\"frozen encoder\\\" 前提，不涉及 median 档位的争议点。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks (orphaned)\",\n    \"description\": \"系统性验证 trained ≈ untrained across 6 methods\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"orphaned\",\n      \"conclusion\": \"All 6 methods consistent: trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\",\n      \"note\": \"被后续更精细的实验取代（plan_011 fulllayer R², d041 definitive RSA, etc.）\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Orphaned，不进入论文。但其结论（trained ≈ untrained）被 plan_007 和 d041 复现， 成为 C3 \\\"observation\\\" 而非 \\\"finding\\\" 的证据基础。\\n\\n\\n此实验在 Phase 1 被 orphaned，其核心结论（trained ≈ untrained in RSA/R²）被后续实验 独立复现。在 median 档位下不直接贡献，但其 \\\"trained ≈ untrained\\\" 的 RSA 结论正是 reviewer 用来质疑 \\\"training effect\\\" narrative 的弹药之一——如果 training 不改变 RSA， 那 training 到底做了什么？Answer 在 C2（routing reorganization），但 reviewer 可能认为 证据不够 conclusive without behavioral validation（A4 partially fails）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Instruction ablation RSA\",\n    \"description\": \"去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"with_inst_untrained_peak_rsa\": 0.4846,\n      \"no_inst_untrained_peak_rsa\": 0.4802,\n      \"delta\": 0.0044,\n      \"gate_threshold\": 0.1,\n      \"gate_judgment\": \"FAIL — Δ=0.004 << 0.10\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Instruction Ablation Effect on RSA\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Peak RSA\",\n          \"Δ vs with-inst\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Untrained + instruction\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained − instruction\",\n            \"0.480\",\n            \"-0.004\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Threshold for significance\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.10\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DINO baseline\",\n            \"0.388\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Reviewer 接受。此 negative result 实际强化了 C1：image tokens 的 action-relevant  geometry 来自 visual content，instruction presence 不影响。但 median 档位下  Reviewer 2 会追问：\\\"if instruction doesn't matter for image tokens, what exactly  does VLA training change?\\\" — 这个问题的答案在 C2（routing at instruction token positions）， 但需要更清晰的 framing。\\n\\n\\nNegative result：移除 instruction 对 image token RSA 几乎无影响（Δ=0.004 << 0.10）。 这证明了 action-relevant structure 是 vision-driven 而非 instruction-driven。 Median 档位下此结论被接受（支持 C1 \\\"image tokens 不 attend to instructions\\\" 的验证）， 但 reviewer 可能指出：这只说明 image_mean RSA 不依赖 instruction，不能推广到 last_preaction tokens（C2 的核心 readout position）。实际上 last_preaction 的 routing 完全依赖 instruction（cross-instruction probe 100%），两个 readout 位置的 independence pattern 不同——这本身是一个 finding，但需要在论文中明确区分。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"2×2 training × instruction matrix\",\n    \"description\": \"四条件全收敛验证 — trained/untrained × with/without instruction\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"trained_with_inst\": 0.4876,\n      \"trained_no_inst\": 0.489,\n      \"untrained_with_inst\": 0.4846,\n      \"untrained_no_inst\": 0.4802,\n      \"bootstrap_delta_ci\": \"[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0\",\n      \"max_pairwise_delta\": 0.0088,\n      \"dino_baseline\": 0.388\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"2×2 Factorial Design: RSA Convergence\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"\",\n          \"With Instruction\",\n          \"Without Instruction\",\n          \"Instruction Effect\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Trained\",\n            \"0.488\",\n            \"0.489\",\n            \"-0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"0.480\",\n            \"+0.004\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Training Effect\",\n            \"+0.003\",\n            \"+0.009\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median 档位的关键 pivot point。此实验的 \\\"null result\\\"（4 条件无差异）在 median  scenario 下被部分 reviewer 视为 limitation：\\\"if your framework can't detect training  effects in RSA, perhaps RSA is the wrong metric。\\\" 这直接导致 C3 从 core claim  降为 observation。Rebuttal 需要论证：RSA invariance + R² divergence = geometry-function  dissociation，这本身是 interesting，但需要 behavioral evidence 来确认 functional significance。\\n\\n\\n2×2 matrix 所有 4 cells 收敛在 0.480-0.489 的窄带中，bootstrap CI 包含 0。 这是 C3 \\\"instruction invariance\\\" observation 的定量基础。Median 档位下被接受 但 reviewer 的解读分歧： - Reviewer 1：接受，认为 \\\"vision encoder geometry dominates\\\" 是 clean result - Reviewer 2：认为这意味着 \\\"neither training nor instruction has meaningful effect \\n  on image token geometry\\\"，进而质疑论文的 novelty——如果训练不改变 RSA，论文需要\\n  更强地论证 routing/R² 变化的意义\\n- Reviewer 3：接受，但要求将此与 C2 的 exit collapse（R² 层面的变化）明确对比——\\n  RSA 不变但 R² 变化说明 \\\"geometry preserved but decodability reorganized\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Random instruction control (content invariance)\",\n    \"description\": \"用 random/shuffled/empty instruction 替代真实 instruction 测 RSA 变化\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"normal_peak_rsa\": 0.4888,\n      \"random_peak_rsa\": 0.4835,\n      \"shuffled_peak_rsa\": 0.4832,\n      \"empty_peak_rsa\": 0.4723,\n      \"max_absolute_delta\": 0.0165,\n      \"instruction_invariant\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Instruction Content Invariance (Trained Model)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Instruction Type\",\n          \"Peak RSA\",\n          \"Δ vs Normal\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Normal (correct)\",\n            \"0.489\",\n            \"baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random tokens\",\n            \"0.484\",\n            \"-0.005\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Shuffled words\",\n            \"0.483\",\n            \"-0.006\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Empty string\",\n            \"0.472\",\n            \"-0.017\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Uncontroversial control。所有 reviewer 认为此实验 demonstrates thoroughness。 Median 档位下唯一 minor concern：empty string Δ=-0.017 是 4 条件中最大的， 暗示 instruction presence 有微弱效应（token count/position effect），但远低于 threshold。\\n\\n\\n三重不变性完备验证：training invariance（plan_007）+ instruction presence invariance （plan_006）+ instruction content invariance（此实验）。所有 delta < 0.017。 Median 档位下被全部 reviewer 接受为 thorough control。这实际上强化了 C1 framework 的可信度——image token geometry 对 instruction content 完全不敏感。 但 reviewer 会对比 counterfactual sensitivity results（C2-X CF）：image tokens 对 instruction invariant，但 instruction/last_preaction tokens 高度 sensitive（d≥0.45）。 这个 dissociation 本身是 interesting，但在 median 档位下被认为 \\\"consistent with  causal mask — not surprising。\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CKA verification (metric robustness)\",\n    \"description\": \"用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，确保不是指标依赖\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"linear_cka_ordering\": \"untrained > trained > projector > DINO\",\n      \"rdm_cka_ordering\": \"trained > projector > untrained > DINO\",\n      \"rsa_ordering\": \"projector >> trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\",\n      \"cka_reversal_detected\": true,\n      \"dino_lowest_robust\": true,\n      \"last_preaction_highest\": 0.127\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"RSA vs CKA Metric Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Representation\",\n          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n          \"Linear CKA\",\n          \"RDM-CKA\",\n          \"Consistent?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SigLIP Projector\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"0.081\",\n            \"0.257\",\n            \"No — RSA >> CKA\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA Trained (img_mean)\",\n            \"0.488\",\n            \"0.083\",\n            \"0.260\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA Untrained (img_mean)\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"0.089\",\n            \"0.246\",\n            \"No — CKA reversal\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DINO cls_token\",\n            \"0.388\",\n            \"0.066\",\n            \"0.241\",\n            \"Yes — lowest in all\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA Trained (last_pre)\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.127\",\n            \"0.290\",\n            \"Highest in CKA\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median 档位核心 attack surface。Reviewer 2 的典型评论： \\\"The RSA-CKA dissociation undermines confidence in the geometric interpretation.  The authors claim 'non-monotonic refinement' based on RSA, but CKA shows monotonic  structure. This metric dependence should be acknowledged as a fundamental limitation,  not relegated to an appendix.\\\" Rebuttal 策略：承认 dissociation，将 C3 降为 \\\"observation under RSA\\\"，强调 C2 （exit collapse, routing）基于 R² functional probe，不依赖 RSA/CKA 选择。 Reviewer acceptance for C3 drops to ~0.4，但 C2 不受影响（~0.75）。\\n\\n\\n这是 median 档位的关键 problematic experiment。CKA ordering 与 RSA 反转—— CKA 下 untrained > trained（RSA 下 trained ≈ untrained），projector 不再最高。 这直接导致： (1) C3 的 \\\"non-monotonic refinement\\\" 仅在 RSA 下成立，metric-dependent； (2) DINOv2 \\\"highest geometric foundation\\\" 仅在 RSA 下成立； (3) 1-2 位 reviewer 认为 RSA 结果不可推广。 但 DINO 在所有 metrics 下均最低（robust），且 last_preaction >> image_mean 的 redistribution pattern 在 CKA 下也成立。 A2 partially 的表现：exit collapse 主要基于 R²（functional metric），不依赖 RSA/CKA， 所以 exit collapse 本身不受 CKA reversal 影响。但 C3 vision encoder geometry claim  被严重 undercut。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark replication\",\n    \"description\": \"第三个 benchmark 交叉验证 RSA inverted-U 和 R² patterns\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rsa_trained_img_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 14,\n        \"rsa\": 0.691\n      },\n      \"rsa_trained_lastpre_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 15,\n        \"rsa\": 0.695\n      },\n      \"rsa_untrained_img_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 0,\n        \"rsa\": 0.652\n      },\n      \"r2_trained_img_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 13,\n        \"R2\": 0.696\n      },\n      \"r2_trained_lastpre_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 21,\n        \"R2\": 0.675\n      },\n      \"r2_untrained_img_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 0,\n        \"R2\": 0.673\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_p\": \"<0.001 for all trained vs untrained\",\n      \"cross_benchmark_consistency\": \"high — peak layers within 2-layer range\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cross-Benchmark Replication (Goal vs Spatial)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Goal Peak\",\n          \"Spatial Peak\",\n          \"Δ Layers\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"RSA trained img_mean\",\n            \"L12 (0.628)\",\n            \"L14 (0.691)\",\n            \"+2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RSA trained last_pre\",\n            \"L12 (0.643)\",\n            \"L15 (0.695)\",\n            \"+3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R² trained img_mean\",\n            \"L8 (0.655)\",\n            \"L13 (0.696)\",\n            \"+5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R² trained last_pre\",\n            \"L13 (0.678)\",\n            \"L21 (0.675)\",\n            \"+8\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Reviewer 接受 cross-benchmark replication。Median 档位下 Reviewer 1 可能评价： \\\"Good that patterns replicate across task suites, but both are within the same  model (OpenVLA). The cross-architecture validation (TracVLA, NORA) is more convincing  for the generalization claim.\\\" 此实验对 A1 holds 贡献但不是 decisive。\\n\\n\\nLIBERO-Spatial 复现了 LIBERO-Goal 的所有核心 patterns：trained inverted-U,  untrained flat/declining, bootstrap significant。Peak layers 一致（Goal L8-L13,  Spatial L13-L21）。Median 档位下此实验强化了 within-OpenVLA 的 reproducibility， 被 reviewer 接受。但 reviewer 会注意到： (1) 仍然是同一架构（OpenVLA），跨架构验证更重要（D088-D094 addresses this）； (2) RSA inverted-U 的 rise phase 在 Spatial 中 Δρ=0.039（Goal 中 0.016）， 略更 robust 但仍在 metric-dependent 的质疑范围内。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Full-layer R² scan (132 probes)\",\n    \"description\": \"33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations — R² per-layer curve 验证 exit collapse\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"trained_image_mean_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 8,\n        \"R2\": 0.6553\n      },\n      \"trained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 13,\n        \"R2\": 0.6779\n      },\n      \"untrained_image_mean_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 0,\n        \"R2\": 0.6403\n      },\n      \"untrained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 32,\n        \"R2\": 0.6093\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_best_vs_best_imgmean\": {\n        \"delta\": 0.015,\n        \"p\": 0.006\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_best_vs_best_lastpre\": {\n        \"delta\": 0.069,\n        \"p\": 0.0001\n      },\n      \"untrained_L10_L13_collapse\": \"R² near -0.33 (pathological)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"R² Peak-Exit Comparison (OpenVLA, LIBERO-Goal)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Peak Layer\",\n          \"Peak R²\",\n          \"Exit R²\",\n          \"Δ(peak-exit)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Trained img_mean\",\n            \"L8\",\n            \"0.655\",\n            \"0.520\",\n            \"0.135\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trained last_pre\",\n            \"L13\",\n            \"0.678\",\n            \"0.609\",\n            \"0.069\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained img_mean\",\n            \"L0\",\n            \"0.640\",\n            \"0.584\",\n            \"0.056\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained last_pre\",\n            \"L32\",\n            \"0.609\",\n            \"0.609\",\n            \"0.000\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Bootstrap Statistical Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Comparison\",\n          \"Δ R²\",\n          \"p-value\",\n          \"Significant?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Best-vs-best img_mean\",\n            \"+0.015\",\n            \"0.006\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Best-vs-best last_pre\",\n            \"+0.069\",\n            \"<0.0001\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Same-layer L8 img_mean\",\n            \"+0.123\",\n            \"<0.0001\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Same-layer L13 last_pre\",\n            \"+1.007\",\n            \"<0.0001\",\n            \"Yes (collapsed)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median 档位核心争议之一。Reviewer 3 的典型 comment： \\\"The Δ>0.10 threshold for 'substantial' exit collapse appears arbitrary. At this  threshold, OpenVLA shows collapse only for image_mean (Δ=0.135) but not last_preaction  (Δ=0.069). The authors should provide a principled justification or show that  conclusions hold across a range of thresholds.\\\"\\nRebuttal strategy：补充 sensitivity analysis showing pattern stability at 0.05/0.10/0.15。 At Δ>0.05：VLM→VLA 仍然 6/6，VLA→VLA 变为 2/4（Goal Δ=0.086 > 0.05）。 At Δ>0.15：VLM→VLA 仍然 5/6（TracVLA Spatial Δ=0.138 borderline）。 二元分离（VLM→VLA vs VLA→VLA）在所有阈值下基本 stable。\\n\\n\\n此实验是 C2 exit collapse 的 foundational evidence（OpenVLA 内部）。 Trained last_preaction 显示经典 inverted-U：L13 peak 0.678 → L32 exit 0.609（Δ=0.069）。 Untrained 则 L10-L13 完全 collapse（R² ≈ -0.33），仅 L32 恢复到 0.609。\\nMedian 档位下（A2 partially）： - Exit collapse pattern 被接受（3/4 reviewers） - 但 Reviewer 3 质疑 Δ>0.10 阈值的 principled justification：为什么不是 0.05 或 0.15？\\n  这个阈值是 ad hoc 还是有统计或领域基础？\\n- Rebuttal 需要补充 sensitivity analysis：在 0.05/0.10/0.15 三个阈值下 pattern 是否稳定\\n注意：OpenVLA 的 R² exit Δ 在 v3 MCCV 修正后仅 0.033-0.086（VLA→VLA transition）， 低于 0.10 阈值。真正的 exit collapse 来自 TracVLA/NORA（VLM→VLA transition, Δ=0.156-0.455）。 此实验建立了 baseline expectation，但 median 档位下 reviewer 会质疑 threshold choice。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CLIP-ViT pretraining control\",\n    \"description\": \"CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 贡献 vs encoder quality\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"projector_R2\": 0.6298,\n      \"dino_cls_R2\": 0.6343,\n      \"clip_cls_R2\": 0.5866,\n      \"vla_image_mean_L19_R2\": 0.5986,\n      \"vla_last_preaction_L19_R2\": 0.6711,\n      \"ordering\": \"last_pre > dino_cls ≈ projector > vla_img_mean > clip_cls\",\n      \"clip_vs_dino_p\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cross-Encoder Action Probe R² (Unified Hyperparams)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Encoder\",\n          \"Pretraining\",\n          \"R²\",\n          \"vs Projector p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"VLA last_pre L19\",\n            \"VLA fine-tuned\",\n            \"0.671\",\n            \"0.002\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DINO cls_token\",\n            \"Self-supervised\",\n            \"0.634\",\n            \"0.557 (n.s.)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SigLIP+Projector\",\n            \"VL + projection\",\n            \"0.630\",\n            \"baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA img_mean L19\",\n            \"VLA fine-tuned\",\n            \"0.599\",\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLIP cls_token\",\n            \"VL contrastive\",\n            \"0.587\",\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Clean result，全部 reviewer 接受。Median 档位下此实验的贡献是 \\\"supporting evidence  for C3 vision encoder geometry observation\\\"——DINOv2 ranking under RSA 在 functional  probe 中也 partially replicated（DINO R² ≈ Projector R²）。但 CKA reversal（plan_009） 仍然 undermines 跨 metric generalizability。\\n\\n\\nCLIP < DINO 在 RSA 和 R² 下均成立，否定了 \\\"VL pretraining dominance\\\" hypothesis。 Self-supervised (DINOv2) 比 VL pretrained (CLIP) 更好地 capture action-relevant structure。 Median 档位下此结果被接受，但 Reviewer 1 可能质疑： (1) CLIP ViT-L 和 DINOv2 ViT-L 是不同的 architecture variants，不能 solely \\n    attribute to pretraining difference；\\n(2) SigLIP（OpenVLA 的实际 encoder）是 VL pretrained 但 RSA=0.615 > DINO=0.631，\\n    矛盾——但这通过 plan_013 branch split 解释（fused backbone 中 DINOv2 和 SigLIP \\n    贡献 equally）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Branch-split RSA (DINOv2 vs SigLIP in fused backbone)\",\n    \"description\": \"分离 DinoSigLIP fused backbone 中 DINOv2 branch vs SigLIP branch 的 RSA 贡献\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dinov2_branch_rsa\": 0.619,\n      \"siglip_branch_rsa\": 0.621,\n      \"fused_2176d_rsa\": 0.634,\n      \"post_projector_4096d_rsa\": 0.615,\n      \"standalone_dino_cls_rsa\": 0.692,\n      \"standalone_dino_patch_mean_rsa\": 0.631\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Fused Backbone Branch Decomposition\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Component\",\n          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n          \"Dim\",\n          \"Note\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"DINOv2 branch\",\n            \"0.619\",\n            \"1088\",\n            \"in-backbone\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SigLIP branch\",\n            \"0.621\",\n            \"1088\",\n            \"in-backbone\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Fused backbone\",\n            \"0.634\",\n            \"2176\",\n            \"before projection\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Post-projector\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"4096\",\n            \"LLM input\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Standalone DINO cls\",\n            \"0.692\",\n            \"1024\",\n            \"different layer\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median 档位下所有 reviewer 接受。此实验的价值在 median scenario 下有限—— C3 已降为 observation，branch-split 的精细分解不会改变 reviewer 对 core claims 的评估。 但它 demonstrates thoroughness，可能为 reviewer 1 的正面评价贡献 \\\"well-executed experimental design\\\"。 Reviewer 3 可能在 minor comments 中建议 \\\"move branch-split analysis to supplementary  to save main text space for the cross-architecture results which are more impactful。\\\"\\n\\nDINOv2 ≈ SigLIP（Δ < 0.002）在 fused backbone 中贡献 equally。 Fused > either branch（complementary benefit）。Projector 从 0.634 压缩到 0.615。 Median 档位下此实验被接受为 clean decomposition： - Reviewer 接受 \\\"both branches contribute equally\\\" 的结论 - 但注意到 standalone DINO cls (0.692) > in-backbone DINOv2 branch (0.619)，\\n  差距可能来自 extraction layer difference（standalone = last layer，\\n  in-backbone = fused intermediate）——这不是 meaningful comparison\\n- 此实验支持 C3 但 C3 已降为 observation，所以贡献有限\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":735,"startLine":1,"totalLines":735}}}
